<title>USA: IPO FILING-Vision Solutions Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING-Vision Solutions Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 Vision Solutions Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $10-$12/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    2.3 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 2.3 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    8,853,710</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter		Allen &amp; Co Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  345,000 shrs Business: Vision, based in Irvine, Calif., develops, markets, implements and supports software that enables the continuous availability of mission critical applications and data on midrange computer platforms.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: Net proceeds will be used to expand sales and marketing activities, to fund product development, to repay the outstanding amount under its bank line of credit and for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s year ended Dec 31:</p>
<p>				   1996		 1995</p>
<p>   - Revenue		 $10,180	     $4,480</p>
<p>   - Net Income		 $142		 $130</p>
